      "writtenOn": "2026-01-15T21:32:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should probably be std::optional\u003cSomething\u003e (no simulations or a specified match). \n\nIn fact, Palette::index should be a std::optional (if empty use the current or the default) and maybe even the fCollectionIndex (use the current or the default). Though those changes need to be done separately with the related changes to the implementations.",
